WEBVTT

01:41.420 --> 01:45.960
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.670 --> 01:48.890
[Episode 33]

01:49.640 --> 01:50.789
This is for you, Master.

01:51.430 --> 01:53.070
Look at this little angry doll.

01:53.289 --> 01:54.009
Doesn't it look

01:54.039 --> 01:55.039
exactly like you?

01:55.479 --> 01:57.039
Next time you feel like getting mad,

01:57.150 --> 01:58.350
just squeeze it hard.

01:59.070 --> 01:59.759
Childish.

02:00.150 --> 02:01.400
Who would want something like this?

02:06.590 --> 02:07.280
Xue Ranran,

02:07.510 --> 02:08.960
you'd better make me fall for you soon,

02:09.150 --> 02:10.430
or your Golden Core will be in danger.

02:17.570 --> 02:18.530
Just like the fierce beast recorded

02:18.560 --> 02:20.000
in "The Collection of Entertainment."

02:23.350 --> 02:25.230
Master, wait for me!

02:25.710 --> 02:26.630
Hurry up.

02:32.240 --> 02:32.750
Guardian.

02:33.630 --> 02:34.870
Ranran, you're back too.

02:38.470 --> 02:40.000
From now on, the daily meals at Mount Wester

02:40.520 --> 02:41.430
will be handled by Xue Ranran.

02:43.400 --> 02:44.360
That's wonderful!

02:44.910 --> 02:45.560
Guardian, I knew

02:45.560 --> 02:46.630
you care for Ranran the most.

02:48.800 --> 02:49.280
Guardian,

02:49.680 --> 02:50.280
those new disciples

02:50.280 --> 02:51.030
you asked us to recruit

02:51.280 --> 02:52.150
have completed their aptitude tests.

02:52.870 --> 02:53.910
New disciples?

02:56.470 --> 02:56.960
Master,

02:57.430 --> 02:58.750
since you're willing to take on disciples now,

02:58.980 --> 02:59.770
why not call back Xi'er

02:59.800 --> 03:00.590
and the others?

03:00.960 --> 03:01.960
They've been waiting at the foot of the mountain

03:01.960 --> 03:02.870
for your instructions.

03:04.400 --> 03:05.750
They're so foolish.

03:06.190 --> 03:06.960
What use do I have for them?

03:07.870 --> 03:08.560
I only want disciples

03:08.560 --> 03:09.870
with exceptional talents and Spiritual Roots.

03:10.630 --> 03:11.150
Well,

03:11.680 --> 03:12.710
with more disciples at Mount Wester,

03:13.260 --> 03:13.930
there will surely be

03:13.960 --> 03:15.360
more trivial matters to handle.

03:15.710 --> 03:16.590
Mount Wester is so vast.

03:17.290 --> 03:18.160
Mr. Yu Chen and Ms. Yu Tong

03:18.190 --> 03:19.240
can't handle everything on their own.

03:20.040 --> 03:21.510
Xi'er and the others know Mount Wester well.

03:21.790 --> 03:23.030
They can be of great help.

03:27.150 --> 03:28.000
If you don't say anything,

03:28.120 --> 03:29.240
I'll take it as a yes.

03:34.400 --> 03:35.360
Thank you, Master!

03:46.100 --> 03:46.680
Who are you?

03:46.840 --> 03:48.030
How dare you trespass into Celestial Sect!

03:53.360 --> 03:54.360
So you're the immortal masters

03:54.380 --> 03:55.700
from Eternal Sect and Hollow Sect.

03:56.280 --> 03:57.590
What brings you to Mount Scarlet

03:58.030 --> 03:59.240
at this late hour?

03:59.680 --> 04:00.410
Where's Wei Jiu?

04:01.000 --> 04:01.680
Get him out!

04:02.080 --> 04:03.190
His Lordship is in seclusion.

04:03.590 --> 04:04.710
If you have anything to say,

04:05.150 --> 04:06.190
you can say it to me.

04:09.360 --> 04:10.470
Many demonic beasts

04:10.470 --> 04:11.470
have been devilized lately.

04:12.030 --> 04:13.400
Is that the doing of you demons?

04:13.870 --> 04:15.000
Devilized demonic beasts?

04:17.880 --> 04:19.089
We don't have time to waste

04:19.120 --> 04:20.310
on something so pointless.

04:21.120 --> 04:22.510
Now that Celestial Sect has been rebuilt,

04:22.950 --> 04:24.630
demons have an endless source of power,

04:25.160 --> 04:27.000
and many lost demonic techniques have resurfaced.

04:27.190 --> 04:28.280
Why would we devilize

04:28.920 --> 04:30.160
demonic beasts?

04:32.030 --> 04:33.000
I don't care how the so-called righteous sects

04:33.030 --> 04:33.980
view us,

04:34.680 --> 04:36.240
but demonic cultivators

04:36.270 --> 04:37.600
and the Heavenly Ones

04:38.070 --> 04:38.680
have just chosen

04:38.680 --> 04:40.000
different cultivation methods.

04:40.480 --> 04:41.840
We exist in the same world.

04:42.270 --> 04:43.270
What reason do demons have

04:43.270 --> 04:44.870
to cause chaos or destroy it?

04:49.120 --> 04:49.480
Fine.

04:50.360 --> 04:51.310
I'll believe you for now.

04:51.909 --> 04:53.040
However, this wave of devilization

04:53.070 --> 04:53.750
is no small matter.

04:54.159 --> 04:54.830
You demons

04:54.920 --> 04:55.920
have always known more

04:55.950 --> 04:56.750
about devilized things.

04:57.040 --> 04:57.720
If you truly have nothing to do with

04:57.750 --> 04:58.720
the devilization,

04:59.159 --> 05:00.040
do you have any way

05:00.510 --> 05:01.580
to help us investigate?

05:03.560 --> 05:03.950
Alright.

05:04.920 --> 05:05.920
I'll send word

05:06.310 --> 05:07.040
for all our demons

05:07.040 --> 05:08.510
to stay vigilant against the devilization.

05:08.950 --> 05:10.040
If we uncover anything,

05:10.360 --> 05:11.630
you'll be informed immediately.

05:16.160 --> 05:17.720
Then consider this a temporary alliance

05:18.070 --> 05:19.240
between us.

05:23.160 --> 05:24.920
Greetings, My Lord.

05:30.120 --> 05:30.560
My Lord.

05:37.800 --> 05:38.510
Elder Tu,

05:39.120 --> 05:40.310
how dare you make an agreement

05:40.600 --> 05:41.240
with the Heavenly Ones

05:41.240 --> 05:42.510
while I was in seclusion?

05:43.630 --> 05:44.600
Since when do I

05:44.950 --> 05:46.190
need to answer to those Heavenly Ones?

05:46.430 --> 05:47.310
This is outrageous!

05:48.950 --> 05:49.880
My apologies.

05:50.120 --> 05:51.430
I overstepped

05:51.430 --> 05:52.190
and acted on my own.

05:53.270 --> 05:54.310
I'm willing to accept punishment.

05:55.120 --> 05:56.270
Expel me from Celestial Sect.

05:57.590 --> 05:58.360
You only need

05:58.360 --> 05:59.750
to announce to the Heavenly Sects

06:00.030 --> 06:01.760
that Celestial Sect has no one named Tu Jiuyuan,

06:02.270 --> 06:03.310
and the agreement I made

06:03.830 --> 06:05.040
will naturally be void.

06:05.190 --> 06:05.680
You...

06:11.390 --> 06:11.950
Everyone, leave us.

06:12.110 --> 06:12.820
Yes!

06:22.750 --> 06:23.390
Tu Jiuyuan,

06:23.950 --> 06:24.830
what's wrong with you?

06:25.680 --> 06:27.120
I merely scolded you a bit,

06:27.560 --> 06:28.680
and you want to leave?

06:32.580 --> 06:33.210
Actually…

06:35.390 --> 06:37.159
Actually, it's not that serious.

06:37.870 --> 06:38.600
I am

06:38.950 --> 06:39.870
a magnanimous person.

06:40.190 --> 06:41.000
Considering

06:41.020 --> 06:42.750
your years of loyalty,

06:43.680 --> 06:44.720
I'll let this slide.

06:53.800 --> 06:55.390
You should be thanking me now.

07:04.680 --> 07:06.190
I once promised the former sovereign

07:06.510 --> 07:07.390
to assist you.

07:08.020 --> 07:09.650
Now that you've rebuilt Celestial Sect

07:09.680 --> 07:10.600
and got what you wanted,

07:11.180 --> 07:12.690
my promise has been fulfilled.

07:13.950 --> 07:15.510
I just want freedom now.

07:18.200 --> 07:20.120
I want to leave this place that has caged me for half my life

07:21.070 --> 07:23.310
and live freely as I please.

07:39.650 --> 07:40.450
Stop!

07:46.680 --> 07:47.240
Why hasn't

07:47.560 --> 07:48.360
your wound healed?

07:50.680 --> 07:51.390
It's just a minor injury.

07:52.280 --> 07:53.360
Don't worry about it.

07:55.360 --> 07:56.159
Your wound hasn't even healed.

07:56.190 --> 07:57.190
Why are you in such a hurry to leave?

07:58.000 --> 07:58.310
You...

08:00.310 --> 08:01.390
Don't tell me

08:02.080 --> 08:03.400
you're leaving because you loved me

08:03.430 --> 08:04.310
but couldn't have me

08:05.010 --> 08:06.040
and your love has turned into hate.

08:08.450 --> 08:09.220
Actually,

08:10.120 --> 08:11.750
that day in the netherworld…

08:13.160 --> 08:14.240
If I told her

08:14.500 --> 08:15.690
that I went back to find her,

08:16.630 --> 08:18.040
I'd be so embarrassed.

08:18.750 --> 08:19.310
Never mind.

08:20.310 --> 08:20.750
You...

08:21.430 --> 08:22.430
Look at you, so badly injured.

08:23.830 --> 08:24.510
After all these years,

08:24.630 --> 08:25.830
you're still so weak.

08:26.660 --> 08:27.220
I…

08:31.600 --> 08:33.360
I'll allow you

08:33.549 --> 08:34.970
to cultivate with me

08:35.080 --> 08:35.750
and share my spiritual power.

08:43.960 --> 08:44.960
Happy now?

08:47.480 --> 08:48.600
My Lord, you misunderstand.

08:49.320 --> 08:50.750
I've long let go of love,

08:51.080 --> 08:52.360
and there's no hate to hold onto either.

08:53.120 --> 08:53.960
I just want to live

08:53.960 --> 08:55.120
a different life.

08:56.390 --> 08:57.270
My Lord,

08:58.480 --> 08:59.320
take care of yourself.

09:01.480 --> 09:02.120
Stop!

09:06.510 --> 09:07.120
Who said

09:07.320 --> 09:08.320
your promise to that old man

09:08.320 --> 09:09.030
has been fulfilled?

09:12.600 --> 09:13.360
My true goal

09:13.790 --> 09:15.120
is to bring back the golden age of demonic cultivation.

09:16.870 --> 09:18.240
Rebuilding Celestial Sect

09:18.240 --> 09:19.630
was only the beginning.

09:21.390 --> 09:22.200
If you want to leave,

09:22.890 --> 09:23.530
you have to help me

09:24.030 --> 09:24.910
break the Five Deadly Formations

09:25.080 --> 09:26.320
at the peak of Mount Scarlet

09:26.910 --> 09:27.570
so I can

09:27.600 --> 09:29.100
reach its dark side

09:29.510 --> 09:31.510
and obtain the legendary Gold Refining Fire.

09:33.720 --> 09:34.910
Gold Refining Fire?

09:36.630 --> 09:37.080
Yes.

09:38.440 --> 09:39.790
Demonic creatures all fear it.

09:40.720 --> 09:42.240
If I can get it,

09:42.680 --> 09:43.590
I'll be able to control

09:43.750 --> 09:45.630
and command those devilized beasts,

09:46.080 --> 09:47.200
bending them

09:47.510 --> 09:48.390
to my will.

09:49.030 --> 09:50.000
By then,

09:50.360 --> 09:51.720
all Heavenly Sects

09:51.870 --> 09:53.510
will have to kneel before me,

09:53.730 --> 09:54.740
and Celestial Sect

09:54.870 --> 09:56.240
will rise above them all.

09:58.240 --> 09:58.960
Only then

09:59.240 --> 09:59.910
will your promise

10:00.030 --> 10:01.030
be truly fulfilled.

10:01.360 --> 10:02.000
Then I'll let you go.

10:02.750 --> 10:03.480
But

10:03.650 --> 10:05.230
if you fail to break the Five Deadly Formations

10:05.600 --> 10:06.890
and get the Gold Refining Fire,

10:07.080 --> 10:08.560
you'll have to stay here.

10:23.480 --> 10:24.080
Ranran.

10:27.720 --> 10:28.550
Ms. Yu Tong.

10:29.120 --> 10:29.720
How are Xi'er and the others

10:29.720 --> 10:30.550
settling in?

10:31.130 --> 10:31.970
Earlier, they went

10:32.000 --> 10:32.840
to pay their respects to Master.

10:33.790 --> 10:35.000
But Master found it troublesome

10:35.320 --> 10:36.510
and just responded from inside the room

10:36.670 --> 10:37.750
without letting them in.

10:38.120 --> 10:38.600
They're now

10:38.600 --> 10:39.720
tidying up their rooms.

10:40.950 --> 10:41.500
Good.

10:42.430 --> 10:45.290
[Su Yishui's disciple, Shen Kuo]

10:42.430 --> 10:45.290
[Su Yishui's disciple, Yue Sheng]

10:43.030 --> 10:44.030
That's Xue Ranran.

10:44.520 --> 10:46.360
She came first in the Marrow-Cleansing Pool

10:46.390 --> 10:48.320
and gained its spiritual power.

10:49.910 --> 10:50.630
Today, I'll cook

10:50.630 --> 10:51.440
a good meal for everyone

10:51.670 --> 10:52.390
to celebrate.

10:58.270 --> 10:58.870
I'll be going now.

11:11.630 --> 11:12.720
Usually, by this time,

11:13.080 --> 11:14.510
she has already brought me tea and snacks.

11:15.200 --> 11:16.200
What's going on today?

11:18.600 --> 11:19.240
Xue Ranran.

11:25.200 --> 11:25.910
Xue Ranran!

11:29.000 --> 11:30.240
Still nowhere to be seen.

11:31.030 --> 11:31.840
How could any girl

11:31.840 --> 11:32.840
be as irresistible as she is?

11:33.240 --> 11:34.600
One step forward, two steps back,

11:34.840 --> 11:35.550
never truly making progress!

11:43.510 --> 11:44.120
Hello, Ms. Xue.

11:44.440 --> 11:45.710
I'm a new disciple, Yue Sheng.

11:45.960 --> 11:46.910
I look forward to learning from you.

11:47.790 --> 11:48.590
Yue Sheng, nice to meet you.

11:49.170 --> 11:49.870
I can wash the vegetables

11:49.870 --> 11:50.840
for you, Ms. Xue.

11:51.260 --> 11:51.930
No need for that.

11:51.960 --> 11:52.880
It's fine. I enjoy washing vegetables.

11:52.910 --> 11:53.480
Ms. Xue,

11:53.630 --> 11:55.270
just leave this kind of work to him.

11:56.670 --> 11:57.030
Alright.

11:57.150 --> 11:57.910
Thank you.

11:57.910 --> 11:58.320
Okay.

11:59.510 --> 11:59.960
Ms. Xue,

11:59.980 --> 12:01.000
let me help with something else.

12:01.510 --> 12:01.910
No need.

12:08.150 --> 12:08.670
Ms. Xue,

12:09.320 --> 12:10.200
my name is Shen Kuo.

12:10.370 --> 12:11.580
From now on, I'll handle

12:11.670 --> 12:12.480
all the cutting.

12:14.600 --> 12:15.270
Thank you then.

12:15.600 --> 12:16.200
It's nothing.

12:16.870 --> 12:17.870
Ms. Xue, let me help you.

12:23.480 --> 12:24.510
You're quite skilled, aren't you?

12:26.090 --> 12:26.830
I learned this

12:26.910 --> 12:27.630
somewhere else

12:27.650 --> 12:28.890
before coming here.

12:29.360 --> 12:30.510
Honestly, I joined Wester Sect

12:30.840 --> 12:32.240
because I admire you, Ms. Xue.

12:32.470 --> 12:33.720
Ignore him, Ms. Xue.

12:33.910 --> 12:34.600
The vegetables are washed.

12:35.090 --> 12:36.730
I heard your alchemy skills are incredible.

12:37.200 --> 12:38.510
Could I learn from you sometime?

12:39.710 --> 12:40.240
Sure.

12:40.480 --> 12:41.240
I'll teach you another day.

12:41.550 --> 12:42.080
It's a deal!

12:42.200 --> 12:42.840
I want to learn too.

12:43.030 --> 12:43.480
Ms. Xue.

12:43.500 --> 12:44.400
You can't learn!

12:45.390 --> 12:45.910
Master.

12:46.320 --> 12:46.910
-Master.
-Master.

12:47.030 --> 12:47.440
Master.

12:47.480 --> 12:47.910
Master.

12:49.440 --> 12:50.240
So lively here, huh?

12:51.240 --> 12:52.200
Since you have so much free time

12:52.220 --> 12:53.130
to chat and joke around,

12:53.610 --> 12:54.810
then go to Westerly Valley

12:54.840 --> 12:55.790
and hold a handstand for 20 hours!

12:56.550 --> 12:57.240
Yes.

12:57.440 --> 12:58.440
Yes, Master.

12:58.910 --> 12:59.440
Wait.

13:00.990 --> 13:01.940
From now on, none of you are allowed

13:01.970 --> 13:02.850
to go near the kitchen again.

13:04.360 --> 13:05.360
-Yes.
-Yes.

13:08.510 --> 13:09.150
Master.

13:30.450 --> 13:31.000
Master.

13:31.150 --> 13:32.470
I brought you lunch.

13:36.670 --> 13:37.150
Master?

13:47.240 --> 13:47.840
Master.

13:49.870 --> 13:51.550
After teaching your junior brothers alchemy

13:52.120 --> 13:53.200
and having fun with them,

13:53.510 --> 13:54.440
you finally remembered your master?

13:55.910 --> 13:56.610
Master,

13:57.200 --> 13:58.720
you're not jealous, are you?

13:59.150 --> 13:59.870
Jealous?

14:00.600 --> 14:01.840
I'm only cooperating with you

14:01.840 --> 14:03.030
to break the Soul-Cleansing Charm.

14:03.440 --> 14:04.270
Why would I be jealous?

14:05.200 --> 14:06.480
Then what is this about?

14:10.150 --> 14:11.320
I just didn't expect

14:11.670 --> 14:13.080
Mu Qingge's foolish younger sister

14:13.400 --> 14:14.510
to be just like her,

14:16.030 --> 14:17.150
flirting with everyone

14:17.670 --> 14:18.790
and being so fickle.

14:19.480 --> 14:20.390
I'm foolish?

14:20.720 --> 14:22.270
And I, Mu Qingge, am fickle?

14:23.120 --> 14:23.750
You insulted me twice

14:23.750 --> 14:25.000
in just one sentence.

14:27.790 --> 14:28.360
Yeah,

14:28.630 --> 14:29.440
you're right.

14:29.960 --> 14:30.630
I do like

14:30.630 --> 14:32.240
handsome, debonair men.

14:35.030 --> 14:35.750
However,

14:36.390 --> 14:36.840
I already

14:36.840 --> 14:38.030
have someone I love.

14:40.390 --> 14:41.840
And I love him wholeheartedly

14:42.460 --> 14:44.100
because no one is more handsome

14:44.440 --> 14:45.550
or more worthy of love than him.

14:48.320 --> 14:49.000
Xue Ranran,

14:49.390 --> 14:50.720
don't just talk the talk.

14:51.240 --> 14:52.200
With your little tricks,

14:52.550 --> 14:53.630
how long will you need to pursue me?

14:53.790 --> 14:54.790
When will you finally break the spell?

14:55.600 --> 14:56.890
Since you put it that way,

14:58.200 --> 14:59.270
I guess I'll have to

14:59.550 --> 15:00.320
take it a step further.

15:02.630 --> 15:03.630
Do you think I'll be afraid?

15:10.000 --> 15:14.460
♫After parting, the black silk-like hair turned snow-white♫

15:15.190 --> 15:20.280
♫In secret, I have so much to say to you♫

15:20.310 --> 15:25.100
♫Only after I met you♫

15:22.670 --> 15:23.390
You just asked

15:23.390 --> 15:24.150
if I was jealous.

15:25.420 --> 15:33.230
♫Did I realize there are heaven-like places all because of you♫

15:25.630 --> 15:27.000
I thought I needed to test that.

15:29.200 --> 15:30.550
So what's your conclusion?

15:33.510 --> 15:38.520
♫Maybe a lifetime is too short, too fleeting♫

15:38.550 --> 15:43.780
♫So we were granted a second chance♫

15:44.520 --> 15:49.500
♫With endless time to write our story♫

15:49.760 --> 15:53.870
♫We fulfill the vow forged through many lifetimes♫

15:54.150 --> 15:59.520
♫From now onwards♫

15:58.080 --> 15:58.630
Wait.

15:59.480 --> 16:00.360
Why are you not shy at all

16:00.360 --> 16:01.360
after kissing me?

16:02.790 --> 16:03.390
Have you kissed someone

16:03.390 --> 16:04.150
like this before?

16:07.630 --> 16:08.030
Yeah,

16:08.750 --> 16:10.120
I once kissed a pig.

16:13.440 --> 16:14.360
A pig indeed.

16:17.270 --> 16:17.960
This is outrageous!

16:18.320 --> 16:19.120
I haven't gotten mad yet,

16:19.390 --> 16:20.320
and she's acting all hurt!

16:21.710 --> 16:23.040
Good thing I brought her back.

16:23.670 --> 16:24.670
If I had left her out there,

16:24.880 --> 16:25.910
she'd end up breaking the hearts

16:25.910 --> 16:26.960
of many naive young men!

16:28.670 --> 16:29.950
Kissed a pig...

16:33.240 --> 16:33.720
Hold on.

16:35.600 --> 16:36.150
A pig?

16:37.550 --> 16:38.080
Could it be...

16:49.200 --> 16:49.840
Elder Tu,

16:50.080 --> 16:51.240
you've tried a lot of times.

16:51.270 --> 16:52.080
You need to stop.

16:52.740 --> 16:53.340
Elder Tu.

16:54.120 --> 16:55.390
Greetings, My Lord.

17:02.720 --> 17:04.160
You underestimate the Five Deadly Formations.

17:04.829 --> 17:06.109
With your weak cultivation,

17:06.480 --> 17:07.510
you can't even break through

17:07.510 --> 17:08.000
the outermost barrier,

17:08.349 --> 17:09.589
let alone get in to break them.

17:10.720 --> 17:11.550
Stop wasting your energy.

17:11.680 --> 17:12.310
Go back.

17:14.240 --> 17:15.589
I can't break them now,

17:16.160 --> 17:17.480
but since I made a promise to you,

17:18.030 --> 17:19.790
I'll find a way to break them.

17:22.750 --> 17:23.400
When I do,

17:24.160 --> 17:25.720
I hope you can keep your word.

17:35.160 --> 17:36.200
Fortunately, Tu Jiuyuan

17:36.500 --> 17:37.780
can't get past the barrier.

17:38.400 --> 17:40.310
If she actually managed to enter the formations,

17:40.710 --> 17:41.790
it would be extremely dangerous.

17:43.110 --> 17:44.920
I've tried so many times

17:45.350 --> 17:46.750
but still can't break the formations inside.

17:47.960 --> 17:48.880
I really need to think of

17:48.960 --> 17:49.920
another way.

18:06.960 --> 18:08.590
He kissed me first,

18:09.070 --> 18:10.680
yet he's making me copy the disciples' rules.

18:19.700 --> 18:20.700
He's just being stubborn.

18:25.200 --> 18:25.790
Again?

18:29.730 --> 18:31.320
The cultivation method Uncle Ye Xin taught me

18:31.350 --> 18:32.270
is already showing results.

18:33.000 --> 18:33.920
Let me see

18:34.240 --> 18:35.550
if I can use this formation

18:35.550 --> 18:36.550
to activate the Soul-Devouring Lock again

18:37.110 --> 18:37.960
and take back Xue Ranran's

18:37.960 --> 18:38.790
spiritual power.

18:43.350 --> 18:44.480
Drawing power from me when I have none left?

18:44.720 --> 18:45.680
This could kill me!

18:54.240 --> 18:55.830
I need stronger people!

18:56.130 --> 18:56.610
Yes.

19:03.550 --> 19:05.400
Fortunately, I took the Spirit-Nourishing Pill in advance.

19:06.550 --> 19:07.030
Ranran.

19:12.480 --> 19:13.400
What's wrong?

19:14.310 --> 19:15.350
Why do you look so pale?

19:15.640 --> 19:16.960
Did Guardian…

19:19.720 --> 19:20.480
That's from Master?

19:30.270 --> 19:31.000
He ordered these dishes?

19:32.080 --> 19:32.560
He said

19:32.590 --> 19:34.270
you have to make and bring them to him yourself

19:34.710 --> 19:36.160
to show you really regret your mistake.

19:36.750 --> 19:37.590
Being stubborn again.

19:38.310 --> 19:39.160
If he wants to see me,

19:39.840 --> 19:40.810
why can't he come himself?

19:42.480 --> 19:43.110
Ms. Yu Tong,

19:43.480 --> 19:44.350
please tell him

19:44.820 --> 19:45.840
my hands are sore

19:45.860 --> 19:47.140
from copying the rules and I can't cook.

19:47.480 --> 19:48.510
He'll have to make do with what's available.

19:49.070 --> 19:49.880
As for me,

19:50.750 --> 19:51.550
I regret nothing,

19:52.200 --> 19:53.310
so I won't go and annoy him.

19:54.580 --> 19:55.940
Exactly. Don't always indulge him.

19:59.030 --> 20:00.000
Oh, Ms. Yu Tong,

20:00.400 --> 20:01.000
there's something

20:01.030 --> 20:02.310
I'd like Mr. Yu Chen

20:02.400 --> 20:03.480
to investigate in the capital for me.

20:03.970 --> 20:04.960
Guardian has already sent

20:04.960 --> 20:05.940
Yu Chen to the capital.

20:06.720 --> 20:07.520
I don't know

20:07.550 --> 20:08.200
if it's for the same thing

20:08.200 --> 20:09.110
you want to look into.

20:10.680 --> 20:13.440
Master is also looking for Ye Xin.

20:16.030 --> 20:17.030
Since that's the case,

20:17.200 --> 20:18.920
if Mr. Yu Chen finds anything,

20:19.160 --> 20:20.240
please let me know as well.

20:24.200 --> 20:24.960
She said that?

20:26.790 --> 20:28.240
Ranran looked very pale.

20:28.480 --> 20:29.480
She didn't even eat dinner.

20:29.810 --> 20:31.040
She rushed back with you

20:31.070 --> 20:32.470
without proper rest.

20:32.880 --> 20:33.480
Before that,

20:33.680 --> 20:35.160
she had been physically and mentally drained.

20:52.640 --> 20:53.970
No matter how good others are,

20:54.000 --> 20:55.440
they can't compare to you.

20:56.000 --> 20:57.240
You're elegant and otherworldly,

20:57.270 --> 20:58.240
like fine jade.

20:58.640 --> 20:59.590
Just like these Ice Lotuses.

21:00.000 --> 21:01.180
They may seem cold at first glance,

21:01.350 --> 21:02.190
but upon closer inspection,

21:02.400 --> 21:03.450
they're refreshing to the heart and mind.

21:03.480 --> 21:05.110
They actually make one feel warm and close.

21:16.070 --> 21:16.680
Master,

21:17.350 --> 21:18.070
it's you.

21:19.070 --> 21:20.030
Who else did you think it would be?

21:20.830 --> 21:21.640
This spirit pool

21:21.790 --> 21:22.590
is on my way

21:22.590 --> 21:24.070
from the study to my residence.

21:24.370 --> 21:24.960
Are you perhaps

21:24.960 --> 21:26.070
deliberately staying here

21:26.510 --> 21:28.030
to awake my memories?

21:42.680 --> 21:43.930
Your flirting tricks

21:44.110 --> 21:45.270
seem a bit dull.

21:47.070 --> 21:48.200
What are you expecting?

21:48.750 --> 21:50.000
I just missed you.

21:50.790 --> 21:51.920
Besides, have you forgotten?

21:52.380 --> 21:53.070
Back then,

21:53.270 --> 21:54.720
you taught me cultivation techniques here

21:54.750 --> 21:55.750
in this spirit pool.

21:55.920 --> 21:56.680
I was just using

21:56.680 --> 21:58.070
the technique you taught me to replenish my energy.

22:01.570 --> 22:03.170
Why is your pulse so unstable?

22:03.680 --> 22:05.310
Did your energy go off track during cultivation?

22:11.440 --> 22:12.270
You've been suffering

22:12.690 --> 22:14.080
from the Soul-Devouring Lock all this time.

22:14.480 --> 22:15.310
Why didn't you tell me?

22:16.880 --> 22:18.000
Are you worried about me?

22:22.960 --> 22:23.680
I'm just

22:24.200 --> 22:25.060
worried about my Golden Core

22:25.550 --> 22:26.880
and want to regain my memories as soon as possible.

22:28.280 --> 22:29.520
Since your usual flirting tricks

22:29.640 --> 22:30.720
aren't working,

22:31.170 --> 22:32.170
perhaps you could try

22:32.270 --> 22:33.070
going a bit deeper.

22:35.720 --> 22:36.510
How

22:36.880 --> 22:37.960
do I do that?

22:38.550 --> 22:39.640
I mean,

22:40.350 --> 22:42.160
you could try being a little more affectionate

22:42.680 --> 22:43.750
or lean on me more.

22:44.750 --> 22:45.550
What were you thinking?

22:52.030 --> 22:53.200
You used to do the same,

22:53.920 --> 22:55.310
telling me to ask you for help more.

23:14.280 --> 23:14.930
Immortal Master Xue,

23:14.960 --> 23:15.510
you're here.

23:15.920 --> 23:16.970
I've prepared breakfast for you.

23:21.350 --> 23:21.680
Here.

23:22.390 --> 23:23.170
Why is there

23:23.200 --> 23:24.310
a special serving for me?

23:26.480 --> 23:27.480
Guardian ordered it.

23:28.350 --> 23:29.200
He said he'll be in seclusion

23:29.220 --> 23:30.260
for the next few days,

23:30.750 --> 23:32.030
so you don't need to prepare meals for him.

23:32.590 --> 23:33.420
Seclusion?

23:33.890 --> 23:34.500
But he...

23:35.640 --> 23:36.310
It's not true.

23:36.510 --> 23:37.280
That's just an excuse.

23:37.350 --> 23:38.640
Guardian may not say it outright,

23:38.790 --> 23:39.590
but I can tell

23:39.830 --> 23:41.200
he's just worried you'll overwork yourself.

23:41.480 --> 23:42.400
He even placed a barrier

23:42.400 --> 23:43.200
around the spirit pool.

23:43.430 --> 23:44.270
Except for you,

23:44.350 --> 23:45.640
no one can approach it.

23:46.120 --> 23:46.930
He wants you to go there

23:46.960 --> 23:48.790
every day at noon to replenish your energy.

24:06.310 --> 24:07.000
Junior Brother,

24:07.750 --> 24:08.790
mind moving over a bit

24:09.440 --> 24:10.550
so we can sit and eat?

24:11.310 --> 24:12.550
There's no space left.

24:12.830 --> 24:13.750
Why squeeze in?

24:14.720 --> 24:15.830
Go eat somewhere else.

24:16.270 --> 24:16.830
Junior Brother,

24:17.730 --> 24:18.250
this table

24:18.750 --> 24:20.160
was ours to begin with.

24:24.480 --> 24:25.350
Is your name

24:25.680 --> 24:26.920
carved on the table?

24:27.640 --> 24:28.440
Did any of you see a name here?

24:28.750 --> 24:29.640
Nope.

24:29.830 --> 24:30.590
Nope.

24:31.790 --> 24:32.830
Me neither.

24:33.880 --> 24:34.400
However, Senior Sister,

24:34.440 --> 24:35.680
if you want to squeeze in,

24:36.000 --> 24:36.590
we wouldn't mind.

24:38.030 --> 24:39.680
Forget it. Ignore him!

24:39.770 --> 24:40.700
How dare you hit me?

24:43.570 --> 24:44.130
Show some respect.

24:44.160 --> 24:45.510
-Let go of me!
-Let go!

24:45.550 --> 24:46.070
Let go!

24:56.790 --> 24:57.480
Let go of me.

24:59.590 --> 25:00.790
Break the spell, you little brat.

25:02.130 --> 25:03.290
Who are you calling a brat?

25:03.730 --> 25:04.450
In Mount Wester,

25:04.480 --> 25:05.830
you're not qualified to call anyone a brat.

25:06.110 --> 25:06.550
You...

25:07.350 --> 25:08.310
Wester Sect's rules have never allowed

25:08.830 --> 25:09.590
junior disciples

25:09.590 --> 25:10.800
to bully their seniors

25:10.830 --> 25:12.270
just because they're more powerful.

25:13.030 --> 25:14.480
A bit of pushing and shoving is one thing,

25:14.880 --> 25:16.440
but using spiritual power to attack someone is another.

25:16.830 --> 25:18.150
Did you intend to kill Senior Bai?

25:20.070 --> 25:21.000
If you continue like this,

25:21.480 --> 25:22.590
when you grow stronger,

25:22.960 --> 25:24.400
won't you end up disrespecting your master?

25:26.110 --> 25:26.880
If I've done wrong,

25:26.930 --> 25:28.030
Master will discipline me.

25:28.240 --> 25:29.240
Who are you to lecture me?

25:29.740 --> 25:30.400
Break the spell!

25:35.110 --> 25:36.440
I'm just someone stronger than you.

25:37.880 --> 25:39.480
You got that line from her, didn't you?

25:42.400 --> 25:42.960
What?

25:43.350 --> 25:44.110
Not convinced?

25:46.230 --> 25:47.640
But it's true that I'm stronger than you.

25:51.200 --> 25:52.160
Master.

25:54.550 --> 25:54.960
Master.

25:55.300 --> 25:55.860
What line?

25:56.240 --> 25:57.030
What do you mean?

26:00.740 --> 26:01.600
You made a racket in the dining room.

26:01.920 --> 26:03.000
No one is allowed to eat.

26:03.350 --> 26:04.920
Carry 100 loads of water up the mountain before you can rest.

26:05.000 --> 26:06.440
Yes, Master.

26:12.920 --> 26:13.750
Wait.

26:19.920 --> 26:21.270
Did you guys

26:21.910 --> 26:23.100
not hear what I just said?

26:23.590 --> 26:24.590
Master, you're punishing everyone

26:24.590 --> 26:25.480
without even asking what happened.

26:26.070 --> 26:26.830
I didn't do anything wrong.

26:27.240 --> 26:28.510
Neither did my seniors.

26:28.950 --> 26:29.820
Why should we be punished?

26:30.270 --> 26:31.000
You did nothing wrong?

26:31.510 --> 26:32.270
Then whose fault is it?

26:33.750 --> 26:34.590
Discord among disciples,

26:35.000 --> 26:35.790
disrespect toward seniors,

26:36.240 --> 26:37.070
and fighting within the sect.

26:37.480 --> 26:39.000
Clearly, it's your fault as our master.

26:39.400 --> 26:40.160
Say that again!

26:40.960 --> 26:42.280
Master, fate led you to take them

26:42.440 --> 26:43.550
as your disciples back then.

26:43.960 --> 26:45.030
You once taught them with dedication,

26:45.030 --> 26:46.030
tailoring your guidance to their talents.

26:46.200 --> 26:47.160
Even if you've forgotten the past,

26:47.790 --> 26:49.310
they are still your disciples.

26:56.320 --> 26:57.160
Did I not let them

26:57.160 --> 26:58.000
stay in Mount Wester?

27:00.440 --> 27:00.960
Xue Ranran,

27:01.590 --> 27:02.080
don't think

27:02.110 --> 27:02.830
just because I allow you

27:02.830 --> 27:03.760
to help me recover my memories,

27:03.780 --> 27:04.880
you can be disrespectful to me.

27:06.030 --> 27:07.200
You see it as a mere task,

27:07.680 --> 27:09.350
but I'm speaking from the heart.

27:10.080 --> 27:11.530
You treat them as strangers,

27:11.880 --> 27:12.590
but they're the very disciples

27:12.590 --> 27:13.720
you once personally chose.

27:14.610 --> 27:15.460
Your disregard for them

27:16.090 --> 27:17.300
allowed the new disciples

27:17.320 --> 27:18.300
to treat them

27:18.590 --> 27:19.830
with such disrespect.

27:20.310 --> 27:20.970
You forgot how they once

27:21.000 --> 27:22.210
respected you

27:22.270 --> 27:23.030
and remained loyal to the sect.

27:23.400 --> 27:24.030
You forgot

27:24.030 --> 27:25.270
how they risked their lives with you,

27:25.680 --> 27:27.400
fighting demons without ever backing down.

27:28.030 --> 27:28.650
Even when

27:28.680 --> 27:30.160
the Heavenly Ones turned against you,

27:30.660 --> 27:32.090
they never walked out on you.

27:32.550 --> 27:33.880
Those things you've forgotten

27:34.250 --> 27:36.180
truly happened.

27:36.590 --> 27:37.720
This bond we shared

27:38.000 --> 27:39.200
cannot be erased!

27:46.110 --> 27:46.920
It was me

27:48.400 --> 27:49.640
who made a fuss

27:50.160 --> 27:51.550
and talked back to you today.

27:52.070 --> 27:53.200
I'll take the punishment alone.

27:54.000 --> 27:54.830
I'll carry

27:55.440 --> 27:56.440
all 400 loads of water myself.

28:01.820 --> 28:02.420
Oh, no.

28:03.030 --> 28:04.110
I didn't bring the Spirit-Nourishing Pill.

28:05.400 --> 28:06.070
-Ranran!
-Ranran!

28:07.300 --> 28:08.060
The Soul-Devouring Lock.

29:00.720 --> 29:01.440
Master.

29:02.370 --> 29:03.130
Last time, you used a spirit talisman

29:03.160 --> 29:04.350
to draw power from me.

29:04.880 --> 29:06.110
But what happened this time?

29:06.880 --> 29:08.240
Even if you have my Golden Core,

29:08.960 --> 29:10.000
without me activating my power,

29:10.070 --> 29:10.830
there's no way you can continuously

29:10.830 --> 29:11.920
draw power from me.

29:17.350 --> 29:17.790
It worked.

29:18.350 --> 29:19.600
I can draw power from you now.

29:20.350 --> 29:20.880
In that case,

29:21.270 --> 29:22.240
from now on, wherever we go,

29:22.400 --> 29:23.720
you need to stay close to me.

29:23.830 --> 29:25.240
You can use my power whenever you need it.

29:35.310 --> 29:36.390
In the past,

29:36.550 --> 29:37.750
you often transferred spiritual power to me

29:38.400 --> 29:39.880
when I was exhausted from cultivation

29:40.510 --> 29:42.160
and when I was injured.

29:43.030 --> 29:43.830
Later, you

29:44.200 --> 29:45.880
directly connected your spiritual power with mine,

29:46.510 --> 29:48.270
allowing me to draw your power at any time.

29:49.640 --> 29:51.270
I wasn't drawing from you by force.

29:52.160 --> 29:53.200
It's just a habit.

29:53.880 --> 29:54.880
I must have lost my mind

29:56.000 --> 29:57.680
to willingly offer you the spiritual power I got

29:57.830 --> 29:58.790
through painstaking cultivation.

30:00.310 --> 30:01.640
No wonder after 18 years of seclusion,

30:02.750 --> 30:03.680
I barely made any progress.

30:05.020 --> 30:05.690
What kind of spell

30:05.720 --> 30:06.590
did you put on me?

30:07.720 --> 30:09.350
Master, you taught me everything I know.

30:10.060 --> 30:10.980
If I had put a spell on you,

30:11.140 --> 30:12.380
you'd have noticed it.

30:13.550 --> 30:14.350
You truly

30:14.350 --> 30:15.480
loved and cared for me.

30:16.070 --> 30:18.070
You were genuinely nice to me.

30:21.070 --> 30:22.590
Sorry, Master.

30:23.270 --> 30:24.830
I shouldn't have talked back to you in front of everyone.

30:25.590 --> 30:27.520
I should have spoken to you properly.

30:27.920 --> 30:29.480
In fact, you haven't changed at all.

30:30.400 --> 30:31.830
You're still soft-hearted.

30:32.730 --> 30:34.250
You'd still help me out

30:34.400 --> 30:35.640
when I was in danger.

30:39.960 --> 30:40.640
How surprising.

30:41.590 --> 30:42.750
You actually apologized.

30:51.440 --> 30:52.110
You do know

30:53.400 --> 30:54.590
how to be seductive.

31:00.920 --> 31:02.240
The Soul-Devouring Lock is a real pain.

31:03.270 --> 31:04.160
Before I figure out a way

31:04.160 --> 31:05.350
to get rid of it completely,

31:06.200 --> 31:07.480
come here every day at dusk.

31:08.430 --> 31:09.670
I'll help you replenish your energy.

31:11.160 --> 31:12.550
As for your punishment today...

31:15.200 --> 31:16.510
I'll go carry the water right away.

31:17.830 --> 31:18.270
Forget it.

31:22.140 --> 31:22.990
If you exhaust yourself,

31:23.070 --> 31:24.160
it'll be my power that's wasted.

31:24.590 --> 31:26.160
That's no different from punishing myself.

31:26.960 --> 31:27.750
Instead of wasting time on that,

31:28.000 --> 31:29.350
you might as well spend some time reading ancient books

31:29.790 --> 31:30.890
and find out

31:30.920 --> 31:31.550
what Dun Tian intended to do

31:31.550 --> 31:32.350
with that heaven-defying spell.

31:33.750 --> 31:34.830
You're not punishing me anymore?

31:35.550 --> 31:36.570
You're right.

31:37.290 --> 31:39.050
Thank you for your concern and kindness.

31:40.830 --> 31:41.750
You're the best, Master.

31:48.500 --> 31:51.090
[Auspicious and peaceful]

32:23.920 --> 32:25.160
Master is not good with words,

32:25.350 --> 32:26.480
but he's kind-hearted.

32:26.920 --> 32:28.480
He often gives pills to the people at the foot of the mountain.

32:29.200 --> 32:29.830
Me?

32:30.510 --> 32:31.480
Kind-hearted?

32:36.480 --> 32:37.680
Master excels at everything,

32:37.880 --> 32:39.030
except cooking.

32:39.200 --> 32:40.550
But the mooncakes he baked for me

32:40.790 --> 32:41.790
were the best.

32:43.200 --> 32:44.720
I baked mooncakes for her? Shouldn't it have been

32:44.790 --> 32:45.680
the other way around?

32:51.380 --> 32:52.900
When Master gets shy,

32:53.160 --> 32:54.680
he turns his face away and ignores me.

32:55.150 --> 32:56.350
If I tease him with jokes,

32:56.610 --> 32:57.680
he won't look amused,

32:57.920 --> 32:59.920
but his eyes turn warmer than usual.

33:01.440 --> 33:02.350
Nonsense.

33:05.310 --> 33:06.440
Salted dried longans

33:06.720 --> 33:08.000
still aren't to Master's liking,

33:08.480 --> 33:09.750
but he doesn't dislike them either.

33:10.240 --> 33:11.270
He once said,

33:11.590 --> 33:12.550
"The past is the past.

33:13.070 --> 33:14.000
It's nothing

33:14.000 --> 33:14.880
more than memories."

33:15.200 --> 33:16.310
He also said,

33:16.590 --> 33:18.640
"Demonic magic is neither good nor evil.

33:18.960 --> 33:20.240
A technique is just a technique.

33:20.640 --> 33:21.790
Whether one is a demon or an immortal

33:22.110 --> 33:23.200
is determined by the heart."

33:25.110 --> 33:26.550
Whether one is a demon or an immortal

33:27.270 --> 33:28.400
is determined by the heart.

33:29.720 --> 33:30.640
Whether one is a demon or an immortal

33:30.640 --> 33:31.550
is determined by the heart.

33:38.110 --> 33:39.310
Those things you've forgotten

33:39.640 --> 33:41.170
truly happened.

33:43.270 --> 33:45.110
In fact, you haven't changed at all.

34:00.160 --> 34:01.480
The lost memories

34:03.440 --> 34:04.790
might return soon.

34:20.590 --> 34:21.230
Master.

34:21.880 --> 34:22.960
I punished you all yesterday,

34:23.510 --> 34:24.840
and you all think it was unfair.

34:25.670 --> 34:26.880
Then today, you'll each pick someone

34:26.880 --> 34:27.590
for a test.

34:32.510 --> 34:33.760
I'll test your entry-level skill—

34:33.960 --> 34:34.630
the Lightness Skill.

34:35.320 --> 34:36.190
You need to stand on the grass

34:36.440 --> 34:37.690
without using spiritual power.

34:38.190 --> 34:38.800
Whoever loses

34:39.590 --> 34:40.920
will have to copy the sect rules 100 times.

34:41.920 --> 34:42.590
That's easy.

34:43.510 --> 34:44.960
Master is clearly on our side.

34:45.480 --> 34:46.190
Yue Sheng, you go.

34:46.440 --> 34:47.510
Make them lose completely.

34:53.830 --> 34:55.280
This is the Flame Lava

34:55.550 --> 34:56.480
from Westerly Valley.

34:56.800 --> 34:57.840
With your current abilities,

34:58.070 --> 34:59.670
if you fall in, your body will instantly melt.

34:59.880 --> 35:00.590
But don't worry.

35:01.150 --> 35:02.400
Before your skin is all burned,

35:02.840 --> 35:03.880
I'll fish you out.

35:04.320 --> 35:05.000
You won't die.

35:06.840 --> 35:07.880
Do you still have the guts to try?

35:08.490 --> 35:09.640
I'm willing to try, Master.

35:34.630 --> 35:35.360
I admit defeat.

35:35.610 --> 35:36.840
I'm willing to accept punishment.

35:42.590 --> 35:43.440
-Senior Gao!
-Gao Cang!

35:44.070 --> 35:44.760
He's fine.

35:45.920 --> 35:46.360
Why…

35:47.920 --> 35:49.190
Why isn't the lava hot?

35:51.230 --> 35:52.510
It's not touching me either.

35:53.560 --> 35:54.670
I felt a familiar chill

35:54.670 --> 35:55.550
just now.

35:56.190 --> 35:57.000
Obviously, Master mixed

35:57.000 --> 35:58.590
the extreme yin water from the spirit pool

35:59.010 --> 36:00.240
with the lava in the cauldron.

36:00.800 --> 36:02.320
The two neutralized each other, so it's not hot.

36:02.760 --> 36:04.320
And you won't get any of it on you.

36:05.480 --> 36:06.640
I knew Master wouldn't

36:06.720 --> 36:07.990
be so cruel.

36:08.630 --> 36:09.760
But Gao Cang didn't know.

36:10.400 --> 36:11.880
He just followed Master's order

36:12.320 --> 36:13.400
loyally.

36:15.960 --> 36:16.550
Master,

36:17.480 --> 36:18.400
you're testing

36:18.400 --> 36:19.550
if what I said yesterday is true.

36:26.430 --> 36:27.410
Some of you

36:27.440 --> 36:28.230
have always doubted

36:28.550 --> 36:29.190
whether Gao Cang

36:29.190 --> 36:30.360
is worthy of being your senior brother.

36:30.920 --> 36:32.470
He's so loyal to me.

36:32.880 --> 36:33.760
That alone

36:34.280 --> 36:35.880
surpasses any level of cultivation.

36:38.050 --> 36:38.890
And there's your eldest senior brother,

36:38.910 --> 36:39.550
Bai Baishan.

36:40.000 --> 36:40.960
Tell us, why do you never

36:41.360 --> 36:42.440
use your left hand,

36:42.630 --> 36:43.960
even though it clearly works?

36:45.230 --> 36:46.190
It's by Master's order.

36:46.910 --> 36:48.360
You gave me a chance

36:48.430 --> 36:49.350
to repent

36:49.590 --> 36:50.960
and return to Mount Wester.

36:51.840 --> 36:53.590
I must strictly follow your command

36:53.990 --> 36:54.880
and never disobey you.

37:01.770 --> 37:02.770
Compared to them,

37:03.500 --> 37:04.690
you all still have a long way to go.

37:08.830 --> 37:10.030
Master has even

37:10.050 --> 37:11.130
looked into these matters.

37:12.070 --> 37:13.760
He's willing

37:14.150 --> 37:15.360
to try believing what I said after all.

37:21.550 --> 37:22.200
Master,

37:22.680 --> 37:23.600
I found a few ancient books

37:23.620 --> 37:25.140
about heaven-defying techniques.

37:25.440 --> 37:25.890
I also made

37:25.920 --> 37:27.080
your favorite osmanthus cakes.

37:33.960 --> 37:35.590
Master was reading "The Collection of Entertainment."

37:36.670 --> 37:37.670
I wonder if he was mad

37:37.670 --> 37:38.840
when he saw he was described

37:39.280 --> 37:40.110
as a fierce beast.

37:45.410 --> 37:46.460
[Roster of new recruited Westers]

37:52.110 --> 37:53.920
The new disciples Master has taken in

37:54.360 --> 37:56.010
are all the children of influential court officials

37:56.240 --> 37:57.450
and regional commanders.

37:58.920 --> 38:00.070
This can't be a coincidence.

38:09.470 --> 38:13.900
[I'm Yue Zhiqiu. I hope this letter finds you well.]

38:09.470 --> 38:13.900
[I once served under you and still owe you a debt of gratitude. Since you're planning something big, I'm ready to follow your orders at any time.]

38:09.470 --> 38:13.900
[To Mr. Su]

38:15.880 --> 38:16.360
Put it down.

38:19.090 --> 38:20.010
These days,

38:20.360 --> 38:21.960
you've been reassembling your old allies

38:22.360 --> 38:23.110
and using discipleship to draw in

38:23.110 --> 38:24.480
court officials and regional forces.

38:25.320 --> 38:26.960
You're trying to finish what you couldn't

38:27.230 --> 38:28.550
and wage war for the throne again?

38:29.050 --> 38:30.090
So what if I am?

38:30.710 --> 38:31.960
Have you considered the consequences?

38:32.590 --> 38:33.920
Of course, I seek what I desire.

38:34.510 --> 38:35.190
Xue Ranran,

38:35.540 --> 38:36.030
don't think

38:36.030 --> 38:37.150
you can meddle in this.

38:41.960 --> 38:43.510
We've been to the border towns

38:44.030 --> 38:45.070
and seen how people live there

38:45.070 --> 38:45.960
after a war.

38:46.550 --> 38:47.670
You said yourself

38:47.880 --> 38:48.760
that peace is precious.

38:49.320 --> 38:50.480
Right now, the Great Qi

38:50.840 --> 38:52.630
faces threats from Gaokan at the borders,

38:53.120 --> 38:54.370
while within, feudal lords and kings of foreign lineage

38:54.400 --> 38:55.250
are assembling their own troops.

38:55.670 --> 38:57.190
The imperial court is barely keeping the balance

38:57.440 --> 38:58.880
to let the people live in peace.

38:59.280 --> 39:00.710
Once the balance is broken,

39:01.190 --> 39:02.420
different forces will get involved

39:02.830 --> 39:04.140
in the fight for the throne.

39:04.630 --> 39:05.920
Are you sure such a rushed uprising

39:06.440 --> 39:07.800
can guarantee victory?

39:08.400 --> 39:09.840
It'll only lead to endless wars

39:09.920 --> 39:10.840
and a country torn apart.

39:12.030 --> 39:13.360
Do you think I care about any of that?

39:13.800 --> 39:14.960
You don't get to tell me what to do!

39:15.480 --> 39:16.230
But Master, you once

39:16.230 --> 39:17.510
risked your life for the peace of the world.

39:18.120 --> 39:19.080
How could you not care?

39:19.110 --> 39:19.550
Enough.

39:20.600 --> 39:21.770
You think I'd believe I did those absurd things

39:21.800 --> 39:22.880
just because you said so?

39:25.860 --> 39:26.670
I, Su Yishui,

39:26.800 --> 39:28.590
have only ever pursued absolute power over this universe.

39:29.280 --> 39:30.440
But the truth is,

39:31.030 --> 39:31.510
all these years,

39:31.510 --> 39:32.750
you haven't tried to seize the throne.

39:33.300 --> 39:34.250
You just sealed the Spirit Spring

39:34.280 --> 39:35.240
in the netherworld.

39:35.840 --> 39:37.440
I don't want you to let your youthful impulse

39:37.880 --> 39:39.550
cloud your judgment and make a decision

39:39.670 --> 39:40.550
you'll regret

39:40.800 --> 39:42.000
because you forgot the path you once walked.

40:07.070 --> 40:07.710
Guardian.

40:10.140 --> 40:11.180
Guardian, bad news.

40:11.360 --> 40:11.880
Ranran…

40:12.360 --> 40:13.880
She's surrounded at the foot of the mountain.

40:17.130 --> 40:18.260
What a troublemaker.

40:19.440 --> 40:20.630
I want one too! I want one too!

40:20.630 --> 40:22.150
There's enough for everyone.

40:23.200 --> 40:24.330
I want Sovereign Su!

40:24.360 --> 40:25.320
I want Sovereign Su!

40:25.550 --> 40:26.670
I want Sovereign Su!

40:26.800 --> 40:27.960
There's enough for everyone.

40:28.710 --> 40:29.190
Alright.

40:30.030 --> 40:30.630
Thank you, miss.

40:30.630 --> 40:31.190
You're welcome.

40:31.210 --> 40:32.930
Let's go and play!

40:38.150 --> 40:38.800
Master.

40:40.400 --> 40:41.710
You bribed Yu Tong

40:41.960 --> 40:42.510
to trick me down the mountain

40:42.510 --> 40:43.840
just to watch this nonsense?

40:44.190 --> 40:45.290
Master, don't be angry.

40:45.440 --> 40:46.320
It's all my fault.

40:47.070 --> 40:47.820
It's just that today

40:47.980 --> 40:49.330
is the Festival of Reverence

40:49.360 --> 40:50.820
in the towns near Mount Wester.

40:51.160 --> 40:51.810
So I wanted you

40:51.840 --> 40:52.800
to see it.

40:53.190 --> 40:54.030
What does that have to do with me?

40:55.800 --> 40:56.950
Because this festival

40:57.310 --> 40:58.540
is held in your honor, Master.

40:59.320 --> 40:59.840
Me?

41:02.280 --> 41:03.310
19 years ago,

41:03.590 --> 41:04.840
war reached Mount Wester,

41:05.150 --> 41:06.920
bringing plague and demons.

41:07.490 --> 41:08.640
Before entering seclusion,

41:08.670 --> 41:09.550
you treated the sick

41:09.880 --> 41:11.320
and saved the people here.

41:12.000 --> 41:13.230
Out of gratitude and respect,

41:13.650 --> 41:14.250
they started

41:14.280 --> 41:15.670
the annual Festival of Reverence.

41:16.840 --> 41:17.550
Master, look.

41:19.140 --> 41:20.140
To them,

41:20.510 --> 41:22.150
the immortals up above are distant and untouchable.

41:22.710 --> 41:23.670
The person in the mountain

41:23.760 --> 41:25.070
who sees them through hardships

41:25.320 --> 41:26.510
and keeps them safe

41:27.310 --> 41:29.060
is the one they truly revere.

41:29.920 --> 41:30.550
Immortal Master Su,

41:31.000 --> 41:31.800
Miss Ranran.

41:32.670 --> 41:33.670
Since you're here,

41:33.960 --> 41:34.590
come in

41:34.710 --> 41:35.230
for some wontons.

41:35.670 --> 41:36.600
Alright, Mr. Xu.

41:36.630 --> 41:37.100
Thank you.

41:38.710 --> 41:39.190
Let's go.

41:42.860 --> 41:43.300
Come.

41:48.800 --> 41:49.440
Here, same as always.

41:49.930 --> 41:50.640
The condiments are here.

41:51.510 --> 41:52.550
Here, Mr. Xu.

41:53.280 --> 41:54.360
You're always so polite.

41:55.110 --> 41:56.720
Immortal Master Su saved my life.

41:57.110 --> 41:58.100
How could I charge him?

42:02.110 --> 42:03.920
Back then, Mr. Xu suffered greatly from the plague.

42:04.300 --> 42:05.450
You saved him,

42:05.630 --> 42:06.800
giving him a second chance at life.

42:07.150 --> 42:08.150
That's why he's so grateful.

42:08.500 --> 42:09.630
When Westers eat here,

42:09.740 --> 42:11.220
he never charges them anything.

42:34.670 --> 42:35.230
Is it delicious?

42:40.000 --> 42:41.670
Master, you once promised

42:41.880 --> 42:43.440
to travel and try everything delicious with me.

42:44.000 --> 42:45.110
But if war breaks out,

42:45.920 --> 42:47.400
none of this will exist anymore.

42:53.800 --> 42:54.480
Immortal Master Su,

42:54.480 --> 42:55.840
Grandmother asked me to thank you.

43:03.030 --> 43:03.710
Thank you.
